WEBVTT

00:02:59.288 --> 00:03:03.954
and in full volume with full confidence
she says to the person behind the counter,

00:03:03.954 --> 00:03:05.704
she goes, “Um ...

00:03:05.704 --> 00:03:10.038
can I get a Marg-herita pizza?”

00:03:10.079 --> 00:03:11.538
(Laughter)

00:03:12.454 --> 00:03:13.746
Not Margherita.

00:03:13.788 --> 00:03:15.496
(Laughter)

00:03:15.704 --> 00:03:19.538
She said a Marg-herita pizza.

00:03:19.788 --> 00:03:22.038
(Laughter)

00:03:22.663 --> 00:03:27.079
Have you ever had somebody
say something wrong ...

00:03:27.121 --> 00:03:28.704
with such confidence --

00:03:28.704 --> 00:03:31.079
(Laughter)